// BEHAVIOUR DELTA ON A REAL MACHINE: on a machine whose IO_CARD_TYPE is
//   NEITHER NewIO_MN200(2) NOR PCI_P64C64(3), golden reads motor.db /
//   motor_SMC.db and attaches per-axis SYNTEK/SMC/MN200/Galil drivers with
