//  arm reads SortArmOffSet[SortOfsAuto4+3 .. +5] instead of [+0 .. +2] -- three
//  entries past the Auto4/5/6 offsets.  Golden also left two dead locals
//  (iAcOfs, iAuto) commented out; both preserved.  Transcribed unchanged.
