    // WHY   :   * InArmPlaceSuck IS defined (cInArmPlacement.cpp:166, registered) but
    // WHY   :     cInArmPlacement.h declares no extern for it.
    // WHY   : Gated as ONE block: it is a single machine-type dispatch and half of it
