    // DELTA : UN-GATE TOGETHER WITH: SetItemAmount + SetMotorCount landing on
    // DELTA : aHotPlateSubstrate.h TMyKitSuck, and externs for the five backup grids.
//AI(W906-W3-9b) 20260925: GATE n4-1 LIFTED -- golden cinitial.cpp:5506-5611 verbatim (88 statements, 0 diff vs golden). The gate's premise (TMyKitSuck without SetItemAmount/SetMotorCount, backup grids undeclared) died with A4-6 8ff6c754 -- see the stale WHY above.
    TestSocket.SetItemAmount(4, 8);                                             //Steven 20241101 : 指定成4x8

